      <h2 class="block-title"><span>Code Enforcement</span>
</h2>
    
  <div class="content">
          <article data-history-node-id="18232" class="node node--type-page node--view-mode-full">

  
    

  
    <div class="content">
      
            <div><h3>Code Enforcement Policy &amp; Procedures</h3>
<p><div class="view-view-file-inline js-view-dom-id-cc5b84c3f24efeb5658aa33e40706670b118459176a9de5150a4122f8a310f91">
  
  
  

  
  
  

  <table class="cols-0">
      <tbody>
          <tr>
                                                                                        <td class="views-field views-field-title-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/cepolicy.pdf" target="_blank"><img src="/files/download_icon_small.png" alt="Code Enforcement Policy Manual file download" /></a>          </td>
                                                                                        <td class="views-field views-field-title"><a href="/sites/default/files/cepolicy.pdf" target="_blank">Code Enforcement Policy Manual </a>          </td>
                                                                                        <td class="views-field views-field-field-description">Adopted August 28th, 2018 by the Board of County Commissioners.          </td>
              </tr>
      </tbody>
</table>

    

  
  

  
  
</div>
</p>
<h3>Zoning Violations</h3>
<p>If you have any questions regarding a property, current case load, and/or potential violations please contact the Department at <a href="mailto:code.enforcement@fremontco.com">code.enforcement@fremontco.com</a> or 719-276-7360.</p>
<hr>
<h3>End of Year Report</h3>
<p><div class="view-view-file-inline js-view-dom-id-17ba592582ace934d5347f517d1fbdea2880cee04b7711450b4d7f91fdf34171">
  
  
  

  
  
  

